                <textElement><font size="9"/></textElement>
                <text><![CDATA[• Schedule Variance: Reflects overall timeline uncertainty across project activities. Higher values signify broader variations between best-case and worst-case execution estimates.]]></text>
            </staticText>

            <staticText>
                <reportElement x="12" y="286" width="510" height="30" forecolor="#475569" uuid="8c9d0e1f-2a3b-4c5d-6e7f-8a9b0c1d2e3f"/>
                <textElement><font size="9"/></textElement>
                <text><![CDATA[• Risk Deviation: Measures estimated schedule volatility around the targeted completion date. Lower values indicate higher confidence and predictable project delivery timelines.]]></text>
            </staticText>

